      "id": "claim_da40ab6311f54a32a4a5ac15c37a8115",
      "statement": "IMAD (Input Message Accountability Data) is assigned by PPH as the Fedwire sender at release, when it builds the outbound pacs.008/pacs.009 message, and is exposed in the v1 API as the fedRef field (null for Swift wires) and in the v2 API as identifiers.imad.",
