    {
      "id": "claim_dd7b3a1200014470889ae6685d343c62",
      "statement": "Fed technical/business rejects are published via admi.002 or a negative pacs.002 carrying the IMAD reference (not an OMAD), since a rejected message was never accepted by the Fed.",
