    {
      "id": "claim_e7a67e610fa2487a8f019561ce738076",
      "statement": "Acceptance of a value message by the Fedwire Funds Service (carrying OMAD) constitutes final and irrevocable interbank settlement under Regulation J / UCC Article 4A, but does not confirm that the receiving bank has credited the beneficiary's account.",
